e         | Lab X      |\n      | address      | 123 Main St|\n      | phone_number | 9876543210 |\n\n  Scenario Outline: Update Chemist Information with Different Fields\n    Given the admin is logged in\n    And the chemist's profile is created\n    When the admin updates the chemist's <field> to <value>\n    Then the chemist's profile is updated successfully\n    Examples:\n      | field        | value      |\n      | name         | Chemist Y  |\n      | address      | 456 Elm St |\n      | phone_number | 5551234567 |\n\n  Scenario Outline: Update Patient Information with Different Fields\n    Given the patient is logged in\n    And the patient's profile is created\n    When the patient updates their <field> to <value>\n    Then the patient's profile is updated successfully\n    Examples:\n      | field        | value      |\n      | name         | Jane Doe   |\n      | email        | jane@example.com |\n      | phone_number | 5555555555 |\n\n  Scenario Outline: Create Appointment with Different Fields\n    Given the patient is logged in\n    And the doctor's profile is created\n    When the patient creates an appointment with <field> as <value>\n    Then the appointment is created successfully\n    Examples:\n      | field        | value      |\n      | date         | 2023-03-01 |\n      | time         | 10:00 AM  |\n      | description  | Appointment description |",
